abstract: >-
  Computational materials accompanying the manuscript of the same title.
  The v1.1.0 release provides code and data for the endpoint reserve design,
  wind-direction and recovery experiments, the sampled predictor and QP
  comparison, and event and uncertainty diagnostics. The release guide
  documents saved-output checks, MATLAB simulation entries, reserve and
  interval-tree replay, and archival access to the original v1.0.0 studies.
keywords:
  - fixed-wing UAV
  - reference governor
  - control barrier function
  - coupled lift-thrust inversion
  - feedback margins
  - computational reproducibility
